  displayTitle: "Ward Two \u2014 Intake Register"
  bodyText: Beds are numbered by the year the wing opened, not by the room. Bed {BED0}
    took the March intake. Bed {BED1} was never used - it is where they put the ones
    who were already gone. {BED2} and {BED3} were the last pair admitted before the
    fire.
